From f00af1ca5cac3d1170b740edbd6187410294f22b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel King <dan@spiraldb.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 01:28:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Align the native Vortex reader with the Arbor revision

Pin the same Vortex revision used by the matched Arbor benchmark. Adapt UUID registration, session writer strategies, and path-keyed footer statistics; retain mandatory Vortex support and exact UUID metadata coverage.
